{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）早上10時許，將軍澳明德邨明道樓一名女住客，被家人發現在家中暈倒，不省人事。</p><p>救護員接報趕抵，證實女事主已明顯死亡。死者姓楊（52歲），警方將安排驗屍確定死因；案件列作「屍體發現」處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"將軍澳明德邨明道樓一名中年婦在家中暈倒，現場證實不治。(資料圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220424/594970577882583040354091.jpeg/P1ip_8bKF9NxJylGWxRjDSsyJ2-ssBx7lp_boZaf26E\"/><figcaption>將軍澳明德邨明道樓一名中年婦在家中暈倒，現場證實不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:23:57.384718+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:40.516687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:17:30.002058+00:00","content_hash":"1a1279af691747f7bb15315174b86c560167a99b9c5e9129f63418b714d0e40f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}